<header><p class="eyebrow">THE GAUCHO WORLD · ENGLISH CULTURAL RESEARCH</p><h1>What Is Yerba Mate? The Drink, the Plant, and Its Cultural History</h1><p class="deck">Mate is both a drink and a social practice. Its history begins long before the modern borders of Argentina, and its familiar gourd and filtered straw make more sense when we look at the plant, its Indigenous history, and the people who share it.</p></header>
